  {
    "number": 127,
    "title": "Add BUNNY activity and component integration dashboard",
    "body": "BUNNY gains a React/TypeScript interface for shared activity, component integration and connection evidence. It uses the approved Nanoleaf Prism/Neon visual language, preserves device-specific modes and routes explicit settings commands through the existing hub/controller services.\n\nRefs #6.\n\nThe candidate adds scoped dashboard context, fixed same-origin assets, memory-only browser credentials, validated editor links, reusable component views, draft/revision guards and bounded read-only reconnect. It covers Nanoleaf settings/mappings and Pixoo filters, with a third synthetic component. General controls, exact previews, installation and physical operations are excluded.\n\nValidation: Node 24 build/type checks; controller/lifecycle/state TypeScript and Python suites and package consumers; MCP service/protocol/package; 32 hub tests and reproducible offline package installation; workflow validation with seven specifications, one active change and six archives; all 15 workflow tests. Dashboard unit/browser checks cover explicit commands, no-write inspection, settings/mappings, attributable subagents, attention/notices, acknowledgment without readership, focus/draft preservation, concurrent edits, uncertain outcomes, read-only access, reconnect and offline isolation. Desktop/mobile axe scans report no violations. Synthetic timing samples are retained for #30, not claimed as full performance qualification.\n\nThe work-guide backlog and shared Codex narrative are refreshed, generated output updated, maintenance/browser checks passed. Existing diagrams retain the planned dashboard boundary until source delivery. Public guide publication remains separate.\n\nPending: independent task review, current-head hosted CI, explicit approval of this new UI candidate, then OpenSpec synchronization/archive and final independent review before guarded merge. Keep #6 open until merged-main checks and completion reconciliation. No installation or device testing occurred.\n",
    "state": "open",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/jimmie-potts/agent-device-hub/pull/127",
